{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32612","headline":"题马太尉华山庄 · 刘沧","name":"题马太尉华山庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别开池馆背山阴，近得幽奇物外心。\n竹色拂云连岳寺，泉声带雨出谿林。\n一庭杨柳春光暖，三迳烟萝晚翠深。\n自是功成闲劒履，西斋长卧对瑶琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}